BugInfo.Description:
XML外部实体的URI设置不当有可能造成拒绝服务攻击或者程序崩溃。  

**例1**：下面代码片段使用Java原生的SAX对evil.xml文件进行解析  
```java
private static void receiveXMLStream(InputStream inStream){  
    SAXParserFactory factory = SAXParserFactory.newInstance();  
    SAXParser saxParser;  
    try {  
        saxParser = factory.newSAXParser();  
        saxParser.parse(inStream,new DefaultHandler());  
        ...  
    } catch (ParserConfigurationException e) {  
        ...  
    } catch (SAXException e) {  
        ...  
    } catch (IOException e) {  
        ...  
    }  
}
```  

**例2**：下面代码片段使用Java原生的DOM对evil.xml文件进行解析  
```java
private static void receiveXMLStream(InputStream stream){  
    DocumentBuilderFactory documentBuilderFactory = DocumentBuilderFactory.newInstance();  
    DocumentBuilder documentBuilder;  
    try {  
        documentBuilder = documentBuilderFactory.newDocumentBuilder();  
        documentBuilder.parse(stream);  
        ...  
    } catch (ParserConfigurationException e) {  
        ...  
    } catch (SAXException e) {  
        ...  
    } catch (IOException e) {  
        ...  
    }     
}
```  
  如果evil.xml文件中包含以下文本
```xml
<?xml version="1.0"?>  
<!DOCTYPE foo SYSTEM "file:/dev/tty">  
<foo>bar</foo>  
...  
```  
  SAX或者DOM解析器会尝试访问在SYSTEM属性中标识的URL，这意味着它将读取本地`/dev/tty`文件的内容。在POSIX系统中，读取这个文件会导致程序阻塞，直到可以通过计算机控制台得到输入数据为止。这样，攻击者可以使用这个恶意的XML文件来导致系统挂起，程序会受到XML外部实体注入攻击。

BugInfo.Advice:
对于使用Java原生DOM和SAX有以下两种修复方法:   
1. 不允许DTD（doctypes），这样可以阻止几乎所有的XML实体攻击  
    **例1**：下面代码片段SAXParserFactory将禁用DTD  
    ```java
    private static void receiveXMLStream(InputStream inStream){  
        SAXParserFactory factory = SAXParserFactory.newInstance();  
        SAXParser saxParser;  
        try {  
            factory.setFeature("http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl",true);  
            saxParser = factory.newSAXParser();  
            saxParser.parse(inStream,new DefaultHandler());  
            ...  
        } catch (ParserConfigurationException e) {  
            ...  
        } catch (SAXException e) {  
            ...  
        } catch (IOException e) {  
            ...  
        }  
    }
    ```  
    **例2**：下面代码片段DocumentBuilderFactory将禁用DTD
    ```java  
    private static void receiveXMLStream(InputStream stream){  
        DocumentBuilderFactory documentBuilderFactory = DocumentBuilderFactory.newInstance();  
        DocumentBuilder documentBuilder;  
        try {  
            documentBuilderFactory.setFeature("http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl", true);  
            documentBuilder = documentBuilderFactory.newDocumentBuilder();  
            documentBuilder.parse(stream);  
            ...  
        } catch (ParserConfigurationException e) {  
            ...  
        } catch (SAXException e) {  
            ...  
        } catch (IOException e) {  
            ...  
        }     
    }
    ```  
2. 如果无法完全禁用DTD，可以采用禁用外部通用实体和参数实体并且禁用外部DTD和禁止实体扩展引用。   
    **例1**：下面代码片段SAXParserFactory将禁用DTD
    ```java  
    private static void receiveXMLStream(InputStream inStream){  
        SAXParserFactory factory = SAXParserFactory.newInstance();  
        SAXParser saxParser;  
        try {  
            factory.setFeature("http://xml.org/sax/features/external-general-entities",false);  
            factory.setFeature("http://xml.org/sax/features/external-parameter-entities", false);  
            factory.setFeature("http://apache.org/xml/features/nonvalidating/load-external-dtd",false);  
            factory.setXIncludeAware(false);  
            saxParser = factory.newSAXParser();  
            saxParser.parse(inStream,new DefaultHandler());  
            ...  
        } catch (ParserConfigurationException e) {  
            ...  
        } catch (SAXException e) {  
            ...  
        } catch (IOException e) {  
            ...  
        }  
    }
    ```  

    **例2**：下面代码片段DocumentBuilderFactory将禁用DTD  
    ```java
    private static void receiveXMLStream(InputStream stream){  
        DocumentBuilderFactory documentBuilderFactory = DocumentBuilderFactory.newInstance();  
        DocumentBuilder documentBuilder;  
        try {  
            documentBuilderFactory.setFeature("http://xml.org/sax/features/external-general-entities",false);  
            documentBuilderFactory.setFeature("http://apache.org/xml/features/nonvalidating/load-external-dtd",false);  
            documentBuilderFactory.setXIncludeAware(false);  
            documentBuilderFactory.setExpandEntityReferences(false);   
            documentBuilder = documentBuilderFactory.newDocumentBuilder();  
            documentBuilder.parse(stream);  
            ...  
        } catch (ParserConfigurationException e) {  
            ...  
        } catch (SAXException e) {  
            ...  
        } catch (IOException e) {  
            ...  
        }     
    }
    ```  
    上述设置功能的方法setFeature也可以换成setAttribute，setAttribute方法用于用户在底层设置特定属性，使用方法和效果是一样的。  
    上述防御需要Java 7 Update 67，Java 8 Update 20或更高版本，因为DocumentBuilderFactory和SAXParserFactory的上述对策在早期Java版本中被破坏。  
    也可以从其他类上着手防范xxe漏洞：  
    如XMLInputFactory、TransformerFactory、Validator、SchemaFactory、SAXTransformerFactory。但这些类都是调用了XMLConstants中的属性，故需要支持JAXP1.5.使用StAX解析xml文件时，以XMLInputFactory为例，可使用下面方法进行防范：  
    ```java
    //禁用DTD   
    xmlInputFactory.setProperty(XMLInputFactory.SUPPORT_DTD,false);
    ```   
    ```java
    //禁用外部实体 
    xmlInputFactory.setProperty("javax.xml.stream.isSupportingExternalEntities",false);
```
